{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43112","headline":"秋闺 · 邵士彦","name":"秋闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斜日空庭暮，幽闺积恨盈。\n细风吹帐冷，微月度窗明。\n怨坐啼相续，愁眠梦不成。\n调琴欲有弄，畏作断肠声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵士彦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}